-2 \amp -5\cr
-5 \amp -2
\end{array}\right]</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\left[\begin{array}{cc}
-18 \amp 1\cr
0 \amp 0
\end{array}\right]</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\left[\begin{array}{cc}
6 \amp 1\cr
-18 \amp -3
\end{array}\right]</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\left[\begin{array}{cc}
4 \amp -1\cr
2 \amp 2
\end{array}\right]</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
